    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "General Arslan. The man who brought down the Pharaoh. Rome has waited a long time to meet you."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "Welcome to my camp. Eat, rest. You will find Rome generous to her friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Your messenger spoke of alliance. Alliance against whom?"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "point",
      "facing": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "Rebels. They hold the old forts in the north and choke the roads to the city. Every week they grow bolder."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "talk",
      "facing": -1
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "Break their walls, and Rome will remember your name."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "Those rebels on the ridge fly the eagle of the old Republic. That is no bandit's standard."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "castus",
      "text": "Old flags are cheap, mason. Traitors will wrap themselves in anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "castus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Then we march north at dawn."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "talk",
      "facing": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "He smiles too easily for a man at war."
    },
    {
      "type": "fade",
      "to": 1,
      "duration": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "text": "THE NORTHERN FORTS",
      "subtitle": "Era II · Rome",
      "duration": 3
    }
